  then calls WC()->session->get('threeds_cavv') without a guard. If the
  session object is absent on this request, PHP 8 raises a fatal error `Call
  to a member function get() on null` and the customer sees a white screen
  mid-authentication. The same unguarded pattern appears at lines 545-549,
  569, 618-620, and 638-639.

  Resolve the session once and branch on it.






