  Sanitize the request headers before they reach the AVS payload.

  $_SERVER['HTTP_HOST'] and $_SERVER['HTTP_USER_AGENT'] are
  attacker-controlled and are used raw. mpgAvsInfo serialises its values
  by string concatenation into the XML request, with no escaping. A
  User-Agent or Host header that contains ` or &` corrupts the XML
  sent to Moneris. A 50-character User-Agent is long enough to close the
  avs_browser element and open another one.

  Sanitize both values and strip XML metacharacters.






  🔒️ Proposed fix

