  Route AVS code W through the postal-match policy.

  Moneris defines W as a postal-code match without a street-address match.
  Mapping W to unconditional accept and a full match bypasses the
  merchant’s configured zip_match policy. Treat W like Z and keep the
  docblock consistent.

